    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d571">

                <pb facs="0650" n="576" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg576"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2078</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at London</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Skinner</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2676</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your despatch No. 6230, dated May 31,
                        1918,<anchor n="3" xml:id="d571-f1"/> enclosing copy of a pamphlet on the
                    Bolshevik revolution written by Maxim Litvinov, Bolshevik
                    representative in Great Britain, has been received.</p>
                <p>The pamphlet seems to be an able <hi rendition="#italic">ex parte</hi> statement
                    of the Bolshevik viewpoint and is filled with those inaccuracies which would be
                    expected in the circumstances.</p>
                <p>In view of the attitude assumed by this Government the Department believes it is
                    advisable that you should have no dealings whatever with Bolshevik
                    representatives in Great Britain.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilbur J. Carr</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
